    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i've seen some people online say you can use actual salt tablets or even just much stronger saltwater to get it fixed faster if they are really weak? i have some old salt tablets in the cabinet from when i had a bad dehydration thing. would it be okay to crush one of those up and put it in his water so he gets a concentrated boost? he just seems so limp and it's scaring me.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
