    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i understand but the weak homemade stuff takes forever and he is barely sipping it... if i just gave him a tiny bit of a crushed tablet, like just a tiny speck in a whole bottle of juice, wouldn't that just help him get his energy back better than a weak solution? i'm just so worried because he's so quiet and just keeps lying there. it feels like he needs something stronger to snap out of it right now.",
